---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { ASSETS } from '../data/assets';
import { SITE } from '../data/site';

const title = 'Privacy Policy - Grave Seasons Guide';
const description =
  'Privacy policy for Grave Seasons Guide: Google Analytics, Google AdSense advertising cookies, how to opt out, external links, and contact details.';
const breadcrumbs = [
  { name: 'Home', url: '/' },
  { name: 'Privacy Policy', url: '/privacy-policy/' },
];
const lastUpdated = 'November 9, 2026';
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} breadcrumbs={breadcrumbs} image={ASSETS.steamHeader.src}>
  <article class="prose-page mx-auto max-w-3xl">
    <p class="section-kicker">Site policy</p>
    <h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl font-black leading-tight text-bone md:text-5xl">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p>Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
    <p>
      This policy explains what information {SITE.name} ({SITE.url.replace('https://', '')}) collects when you visit,
      how it is used, and the choices you have. The site is an independent fan guide; see the
      <a href="/terms/">Terms of Use</a> for the rules that apply to using it.
    </p>

    <h2>Information we collect</h2>
    <p>
      We do not ask visitors to create accounts, and the site has no comment forms or sign-ups. The only personal
      information we receive directly is what you choose to send by email. Like most websites, the services described
      below automatically collect technical data such as pages viewed, referring pages, browser and device type,
      approximate location derived from your IP address, and the time of your visit.
    </p>

    <h2>Google Analytics</h2>
    <p>
      This site uses Google Analytics (a service of Google LLC) to understand how visitors use the site, for example
      which guides are read most and how people arrive here. Google Analytics uses cookies and similar technologies to
      collect usage data, which Google processes under its own privacy policy. We use these reports in aggregate to
      improve the guide; we do not use them to identify individual visitors. You can learn more at
      <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer">How Google uses information from sites that use its services</a>,
      and you can opt out with the
      <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer">Google Analytics opt-out browser add-on</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>Advertising and Google AdSense</h2>
    <p>
      We use, or may use, Google AdSense to show advertisements on this site. Third-party vendors, including Google,
      use cookies to serve ads based on your prior visits to this website or other websites. Google's use of
      advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads to you based on your visits to this site and/or
      other sites on the internet.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>
        You can opt out of personalized advertising by visiting
        <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer">Google Ads Settings</a>.
      </li>
      <li>
        You can opt out of some third-party vendors' use of cookies for personalized advertising by visiting
        <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer">www.aboutads.info</a>.
      </li>
      <li>
        Google's advertising practices are described in
        <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer">How Google uses cookies in advertising</a>.
      </li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      If you opt out, you may still see ads, but they will not be personalized based on your browsing.
    </p>

    <h2>Managing cookies</h2>
    <p>
      Most browsers let you block or delete cookies in their settings. Blocking cookies will not stop you from reading
      the guide, though analytics and ad personalization will not work as described above.
    </p>

    <h2>External links</h2>
    <p>
      This site links to Steam, Blumhouse, PlayStation, Microsoft, and other official or relevant pages. Those websites
      have their own privacy policies, and we are not responsible for how they handle your data.
    </p>

    <h2>Children's privacy</h2>
    <p>
      This site is not directed at children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect personal information from them.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>
      We may update this policy when the services we use change. The "Last updated" date above shows when it was last
      revised.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      For privacy questions, email <a href={`mailto:${SITE.contactEmail}`}>{SITE.contactEmail}</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</Layout>
